ipp-usb-api(7) "Control API for ipp-usb"

# NAME

ipp-usb-api - Control API for *ipp-usb* daemon

# DESCRIPTION

The *ipp-usb* control API provides a way for local client
applications to communicate with the running *ipp-usb* daemon.

The API uses a UNIX domain socket.

# PROTOCOL

## Overview

The control API uses HTTP over a UNIX domain socket. Requests are
sent using the HTTP GET and POST methods.

The protocol is versioned independently of the *ipp-usb* software
release. The protocol version identifies the *ipp-usb* release in
which the latest protocol changes were introduced. It remains
unchanged across software releases that do not change the protocol.

The protocol is backward compatible. New endpoints and request
parameters may be introduced in later protocol versions without
breaking existing clients.

The protocol version in which each endpoint and each request or
response field was introduced is documented below.

# REQUESTS

## GET /status (since 0.9.22)

*Authentication required*: none++
*Response Content-Type:* text/plain

This is a legacy request. It returns a formatted status page
containing the same information as the output of the ipp-usb status
command.

## GET /version (since 0.9.35)

*Authentication required*: none++
*Response Content-Type:* text/plain

Returns the protocol version as a plain-text string.

The version identifies the *ipp-usb* release in which the latest
protocol changes were introduced. For example:

```
0.9.35
```

The returned version does not necessarily match the version of the
running ipp-usb daemon.

Assume version *0.9.22* if *404 Not found* error is returned.

## POST /get/conf (since 0.9.35)

*Authentication required*: none++
*Request Content-Type:* application/json++
*Response Content-Type:* application/json

*Request data:*
```
    {
      // Device identification; all fields are optional
      "usb_MFG"  : "Xerox",
      "usb_MDL"  : "B235 MFP",
      "usb_SN"   : "34004H030206H",
      "usb_HWID" : "0924&9d3b",
      "usb_URI"  : "usb://Xerox/B235%20MFP?serial=34004H030206H",
    }
```

*Error response:*
```
    {
      "err": "error message"
    }
```

*Data response:*
```
    {
      // Array of devices, matching the search criteria
      "data": [
        {
          // Device identification
          "usb_MFG"  : "Xerox",
          "usb_MDL"  : "B235 MFP",
          "usb_SN"   : "34004H030206H",
          "usb_HWID" : "0924&9d3b",
          "usb_URI"  : "usb://Xerox/B235%20MFP?serial=34004H030206H",

          // Settings
          "disabled" : false,
        },
      ]
    }
```

This request returns array of per-device configuration records.
Parameters of request specify search criteria. If no matching
devices were found, empty array is returned.

# FILES

*/var/ipp-usb/ctrl*
	*ipp-usb* control socket

